<title>USA: Publicker bolsters share buy back plan.</title>
<headline>Publicker bolsters share buy back plan.</headline>
<dateline>OLD GREENWICH, Conn 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Publicker Industries Inc said Monday its board had increased the amount of shares that it could buy back to 2.0 million from 1.0 million.</p>
<p>It said it had already bought back 789,500 shares since the repurchase program began in August.</p>
<p>Publicker, which has 14.5 million share outstanding, is a diversified group of companies involved in manufacturing and services.</p>
